node_modules
# The Dockerfile COPYs exactly two paths out of .next/ (standalone, static).
# Everything else — build manifests, traces, server output, and the 400MB+
# cache — was being uploaded to the remote builder on every deploy and never
# used: CI reported a 107MB context. Excluding it shortens every deploy and
# narrows the transfer window in which a builder-side network failure can
# land. Negation requires excluding the CHILDREN (.next/*), not .next itself.
.next/*
!.next/standalone
!.next/static
out
.git
.env.local
.env*.local
npm-debug.log*
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
